          }
        },
        "description": "Deterministic required-field and primitive scalar-type checks only. No truth, identity, authorisation or regulatory assurance. Free evaluation USD 0.00; USD 0.03 is indicative future pricing only; payments disabled. Server-side HTTPS clients supported; cross-origin browser execution is restricted. 429/503 refusals do not promise availability."
      }
    }
  },
  "security": []
